{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In twenty sixteen,",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "a grandmother in Arizona invited a total stranger to Thanksgiving.",
   "start": 1.35,
   "end": 5.38
  },
  {
   "text": "By accident.",
   "start": 5.44,
   "end": 6.3
  },
  {
   "text": "She texted her grandson the time and place.",
   "start": 6.792,
   "end": 8.757
  },
  {
   "text": "But her grandson had changed his number.",
   "start": 8.757,
   "end": 11.092
  },
  {
   "text": "The text landed on a seventeen-year-old.",
   "start": 11.57,
   "end": 14.053
  },
  {
   "text": "In the middle of class.",
   "start": 14.053,
   "end": 15.36
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked, \"Who is this?\"",
   "start": 15.71,
   "end": 17.16
  },
  {
   "text": "She said, \"Grandma.\"",
   "start": 17.59,
   "end": 18.94
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked for a picture.",
   "start": 19.22,
   "end": 20.47
  },
  {
   "text": "She sent a selfie.",
   "start": 20.57,
   "end": 21.59
  },
  {
   "text": "Definitely not his grandma.",
   "start": 21.771,
   "end": 23.567
  },
  {
   "text": "So he sent one back,",
   "start": 24.063,
   "end": 25.07
  },
  {
   "text": "and asked the only question that mattered:",
   "start": 25.15,
   "end": 27.4
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Can I still get a plate?\"",
   "start": 27.76,
   "end": 28.95
  },
  {
   "text": "She said, \"Of course.",
   "start": 29.231,
   "end": 30.54
  },
  {
   "text": "That's what grandmas do.",
   "start": 30.63,
   "end": 31.63
  },
  {
   "text": "Feed everyone.\"",
   "start": 31.97,
   "end": 33.16
  },
  {
   "text": "He showed up.",
   "start": 33.532,
   "end": 34.46
  },
  {
   "text": "So did the news crews.",
   "start": 34.46,
   "end": 35.64
  },
  {
   "text": "He could barely find a parking spot.",
   "start": 35.89,
   "end": 37.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he came back the next year.",
   "start": 38.16,
   "end": 40.06
  },
  {
   "text": "And the next.",
   "start": 40.18,
   "end": 40.91
  },
  {
   "text": "When her husband passed away,",
   "start": 41.571,
   "end": 43.161
  },
  {
   "text": "he was at her table.",
   "start": 43.161,
   "end": 43.975
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten Thanksgivings later,",
   "start": 44.495,
   "end": 45.94
  },
  {
   "text": "they're still at it.",
   "start": 45.97,
   "end": 47.0
  },
  {
   "text": "All because one text reached the wrong person,",
   "start": 47.465,
   "end": 49.765
  },
  {
   "text": "and the wrong person answered.",
   "start": 49.765,
   "end": 51.482
  },
  {
   "text": "Not everyone gets a text like that.",
   "start": 52.077,
   "end": 53.675
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 54.208,
   "end": 55.77
  },
  {
   "text": "Text Jenny any time,",
   "start": 56.05,
   "end": 57.31
  },
  {
   "text": "and someone always answers.",
   "start": 57.41,
   "end": 59.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 59.385,
   "end": 60.849
  }
 ]
}